| `work_naming.backlog_id` | string | `^[A-Z][A-Z0-9]*(?:-[A-Z][A-Z0-9]*)*-[1-9][0-9]*$`: an upper-case prefix, a hyphen and a number | a Python regular expression | check_Z; `tests/integration/test_work_trailers.py` | Changes which values the backlog trailer accepts. Syntax, recursion and overflow compilation faults give one key-naming FAILURE finding without the pattern or exception text. | a slice id: `work_naming.slice_id` | always |
